  "Vypočítaj $\\bar{x}$ a $\\bar{y}$. Zadaj ich v tvare „x̄; ȳ“.": "Calcule $\\bar{x}$ e $\\bar{y}$. Escreva-os na forma “x̄; ȳ”.",
  "Vypočítaj $\\chi^2$. {@0}": "Calcule $\\chi^2$. {@0}",
  "Vypočítaj $\\chi^2=\\sum\\frac{(N_i-np_i)^2}{np_i}$ a porovnaj ho s kvantilom $\\chi^2_{0{,}95}(k-1)$.": "Calcule $\\chi^2=\\sum\\frac{(N_i-np_i)^2}{np_i}$ e compare-o com o quantil $\\chi^2_{0{,}95}(k-1)$.",
  "Vypočítaj $\\hat{y}({@0})$.": "Calcule $\\hat{y}({@0})$.",
